# results/

Materialized outputs land here, one file per result, at the place ASTRA
gives it: named from the output's id and the `format` its spec declares,
in a folder for the universe it is built in.

    results/<universe>/<output_id>.<format>
    results/<output_id>.<format>        (an output built once)

The record of how each was made is at `.astra/records/`, at the same
path with `.json`.
